airdeliver/
├── frontend/web/
│   ├── src/                    # app, components, hooks, lib, types, auth, proxy
│   ├── public/                 # static assets
│   ├── __tests__/              # web behavior and source contracts
│   └── Dockerfile / framework configuration
├── backend/api/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── api/v1/             # HTTP routes
│   │   ├── services/           # domain owners plus legacy import entrypoints
│   │   │   ├── conversation/ / catalog/ / cart/ / checkout/ / payments/
│   │   │   ├── memory/ / behavior/ / retrieval/ / research/
│   │   │   └── provider_capacity/ / infrastructure/ / observability/
│   │   └── core/ / crud/ / db/ / models/ / schemas/ / websockets/
│   ├── tools/                  # original maintenance helpers, approval required
│   ├── scripts/                # API-specific validation and evaluation commands
│   ├── tests/ / fixtures/ / evaluation/
│   ├── alembic/versions/       # immutable migration history
│   └── worker_entrypoint.py / Dockerfile / pyproject.toml / poetry.lock
├── apps/                       # relative compatibility aliases, not duplicate apps
│   ├── web -> ../frontend/web
│   └── api -> ../backend/api
├── infra/
│   ├── database/init/ / observability/ / k8s/
│   └── minio-ce/ / s3/ / storage-ci/ / postgres-backup/
├── scripts/                    # dev/ / ops/ / ci/ and legacy command aliases
├── docs/                       # architecture/ / development/ / runbooks/
│                               # decisions/ / security/ / engineering/
│                               # verification/ / catalog/ and legacy doc aliases
├── tests/load/                 # stack/load harness, not production evidence
├── docker-compose*.yml         # stable root orchestration entrypoints
├── package.json / pnpm-workspace.yaml / pnpm-lock.yaml
└── README.md / RUNBOOK.md / SECURITY.md / LICENSE.txt
